===== unravis audit timelines =====
Compare the timelines of several groups

Usage:
  unravis audit timelines [flags]
  unravis audit timelines [command]

Available Commands:
  compare     Compare 1 to 8 groups on aligned time slots (from the stored comparison)

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for timelines

Global Flags:
      --json                 same as -o json
      --no-color             no colour (there is none yet)
  -o, --output string        output format: table, json or jsonl (default "table")
      --output-file string   write JSON output to a new file (json mode only)
      --overwrite            with --output-file: replace an existing file
      --profile string       run as an automation profile (not available yet)
  -q, --quiet                no progress text on stderr
      --request string       the arguments of the operation as one JSON object, from a file or - for the input
      --timeout duration     give up after this long (at most 1h) (default 30s)

Use "unravis audit timelines [command] --help" for more information about a command.
===== unravis audit timelines compare =====
Compare 1 to 8 groups on aligned time slots (from the stored comparison). Give the same arguments as one JSON object with --request FILE (or - for the input) to use every field of the tool ('unravis schema audit.timelines.compare' lists them).

Usage:
  unravis audit timelines compare --result-id ID --api-key KEY [--api-key KEY ...] [flags]

Flags:
      --api-key stringArray   the exact group key from 'audit compare' or 'audit groups' (never rebuild it from names); repeat for up to 8
  -h, --help                  help for compare
      --result-id string      the result id that 'audit compare' printed

